          "byteEnd": 444,
          "byteCount": 286,
          "sha256": "db2480ded5111af473655383cf1132e77771d4b2f4598f2202a3ddf4ba8be1da",
          "text": "Cut 1 has three owner-approved fictional synthetic identity anchors: Meera,\nMyra, and Raj. Later narration, TTS, rendering, and UI work needs one stable\nidentity contract without importing provider-specific profiles or trusting a\ncaller-supplied asset, voice, lifecycle, or trace claim."
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_presenter_span_02",
          "byteStart": 880,
          "byteEnd": 977,
          "byteCount": 97,
          "sha256": "8434913a88ad193595bf4e47fa3fc74454472f718c7358a5ffd789a8e26dfccd",
          "text": "Production identity IDs are exactly\n`meera`, `myra`, and `raj`, each at semantic version `1.0.0`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
