          "sha256": "1b526533d2c681665d79670e3b9bc6e7bbe426ef4e2005008d1602767efea6dd",
          "text": "Visible brand spelling is exactly `StackClimb`.\nRohit Agrawal founded, owns, and leads StackClimb and conceived, owns, and\nproduces NarraTwin AI under StackClimb."
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_stage_plan_span_02",
          "byteStart": 118291,
          "byteEnd": 118528,
          "byteCount": 237,
          "sha256": "37e0af48035b3297158f9671a1df9f1a900570414e88f2d68a47818525735a98",
          "text": "The exact canonical narration and presenter substitution rule live in OWNER\ncomment `5197711390`: Myra and Raj replace only both occurrences of `Meera`.\nTTS accepts only the latest evaluated script version after explicit speech\napproval."
        }
