          "sha256": "e5fe23a9384475d565421fc2a959b58143d0d52e123728286d98af6954f8c965",
          "text": "NarraTwin AI must remain portable across local development, free engineering mode,\nand future premium showcase mode. Users and maintainers must be able to replace\nproviders, export project data, regenerate derived artifacts, and run tests without\npaid provider keys."
